title: A resumed round's finished signal, before this ticket
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant O as the orchestrator
    participant R as the runner
    participant W as the worker
    participant B as report.md<br/>on the ticket branch
    participant T as the ticket file
    Note over B: round one's report is committed here
    O->>R: resume
    R->>W: continue
    W--xR: exits nonzero, having written nothing
    R->>B: is a report there?
    B-->>R: yes, round one's
    R-->>O: report=yes
    O->>T: import the report the branch carries
    T--xO: refused: tag D1 is already taken
    Note over O,T: the message points at the tags, not at the stale report
